      "message": "@zane.li.wiwynn@gmail.com \nGeneral DBus interfaces behavior can be slightly different as interfaces are different, but in general the event behavior shall be same as in https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/75997/37/src/Thresholds.cpp . Can you please compare and contrast with that PR for discussion?",
      "parentUuid": "a71c99c6_a335d7fa",
